~$*


# User-specific files
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.vcxproj.filters

# SQLite database files (Forge runtime data — too large for git)
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal

# Forge plan-doc protection snapshots (Phase 41). Created by
# CrewStoryArtifactStrategy.RunIterativeRefineLoopAsync before each
# generator iter to recover from a generator that deletes/truncates
# the protected file. Cleaned up in try/finally — but if a snapshot
# ever leaks (e.g., process killed between create and delete), this
# rule stops it from being committed to source by the next engineer.
*.iter-snapshot.bak

# User-specific files (MonoDevelop/Xamarin Studio)
*.userprefs

